<title>USA: Checkers Drive-In extends default waivers.</title>
<headline>Checkers Drive-In extends default waivers.</headline>
<dateline>CLEARWATER, Fla. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Checkers Drive-In Restaurants Inc said on Tuesday it was still negotiating the restructuring of its $36 million debt and had extended the default waivers through September 13, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it previously extended the waivers until Sept. 10.</p>
</text>
